 or 1 of your Characters.","trigger":""},"EB02-004":{"effect":"","trigger":""},"EB02-005":{"effect":"[Your Turn] This Character gains +2000 power. [Opponent's Turn] Give this Character −2000 power.","trigger":""},"EB02-006":{"effect":"[Activate: Main] [Once Per Turn] If your Leader has the {Land of Wano} type or is [Portgas.D.Ace], give up to 1 rested DON!! card to your Leader. Then, this Character gains [Rush] during this turn.","trigger":""},"EB02-007":{"effect":"[Main] Up to a total of 3 of your Leader or Characters gain +1000 power during this turn. Then, K.O. up to 1 of your opponent's Characters with 3000 power or less.","trigger":"[Trigger] K.O. up to 1 of your opponent's Characters with 4000 power or less."},"EB02-008":{"effect":"[Main] Look at 4 cards from the top of your deck; reveal up to 1 card with a cost of 4 or more and add it to your hand. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order.","trigger":"[Trigger] Activate this card's [Main] effect."},"EB02-009":{"effect":"[Activate: Main] You may rest this Stage: Give up to 1 of your currently given DON!! cards to 1 of your {Straw Hat Crew} type Characters.","trigger":""},"EB02-010":{"effect":"[Activate: Main] [Once Per Turn] DON!! −2: If the only Characters on your field are {Straw Hat Crew} type Characters, set up to 2 of your DON!! cards as active and this Leader gains +1000 power until the end of your opponent's next turn.","trigger":""},"EB02-011":{"effect":"[On Play] If your Leader has the {Fish-Man} or {East Blue} type, give up to 1 rested DON!! card to your Leader. Then, up to 1 of your opponent's Characters with a cost of 5 or less cannot be rested until the end of your opponent's next turn.","trigger":""},"EB02-012":{"effect":"If you have [Sarfunkel], this Character gains [Blocker].","trigger":""},"EB02-013":{"effect":"[On Play] If you have 3 or more DON!! cards on your field, look at 7 cards from the top of your deck; reveal up to 1 [Zou] and add it to your hand. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order and play up to 1 [Zou] from your hand.","trigger":""},"EB02-014":{"effect":"[On Play] Play up to 1 [Gaimon] from your hand.","trigger":""},"EB02-015":{"effect":"[On Play] Up to 1 of your opponent's rested Characters will not become active in your opponent's next Refresh Phase. Then, set up to 1 of your DON!! cards as active at the end of this turn.","trigger":""},"EB02-016":{"effect":"Also treat this card's name as [Tony Tony.Chopper] according to the rules. [On Play] Play up to 1 {Animal} type Character with a cost of 3 or less from your hand.","trigger":""},"EB02-017":{"effect":"[On Play] Look at 5 cards from the top of your deck; reveal up to 1 {Straw Hat Crew} type card other than [Nami] and add it to your hand. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order.","trigger":""},"EB02-018":{"effect":"[On Play] If you have no other [Buggy] Characters, up to 1 of your Leader gains [Double Attack] during this turn.","trigger":"[Trigger] Rest up to 1 of your opponent's Characters with a cost of 4 or less."},"EB02-019":{"effect":"If your opponent has 2 or more Characters, this Character can attack Characters on the turn in which it is played. [On Play] If your Leader has the {Straw Hat Crew} type, rest up to 1 of your opponent's Characters with a cost of 4 or less.","trigger":""},"EB02-020":{"effect":"[Main] Look at 4 cards from the top of your deck; reveal up to 1 card with a cost of 4 or more and add it to your hand. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order.","trigger":"[Trigger] Activate this card's [Main] effect."},"EB02-021":{"effect":"[Main] Up to 1 of your {Straw Hat Crew} type Characters gains +6000 power during this turn. It will not become active in your next Refresh Phase.","trigger":"[Trigger] Rest up to 1 of your opponent's Characters with a cost of 4 or less."},"EB02-022":{"effect":"[On Play] If you have 2 or less Characters with 5000 power or more, play up to 1 Character with 6000 power or less and no base effect from your hand.","trigger":""},"EB02-023":{"effect":"[Your Turn] [Once Per Turn] When your opponent's Character is returned to the owner's hand by your effect, look at 3 cards from the top of your deck and place them at the top or bottom of the deck in any order.","trigger":""},"EB02-024":{"effect":"Also treat this card's name as [Usopp] according to the rules. [On Play] Draw 2 cards. Then, place 2 cards from your hand at the bottom of your deck in any order. Then, return up to 1 Character with a cost of 1 or less to the owner's hand.","trigger":""},"EB02-025":{"effect":"[Activate: Main] ① You may rest this Character: If your Leader is [Donquixote Rosinante], look at 5 cards from the top of your deck; play up to 1 Character with a cost of 2 or less rested. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order.","trigger":""},"EB02-026":{"effect":"[On Play] If your Leader is multicolored and you have 5 or less cards in your hand, draw 2 cards.","trigger":""},"EB02-027":{"effect":"[On Play] Place up to 1 of your opponent's Characters with 1000 power or less at the bottom of the owner's deck.","trigger":""},"EB02-028":{"effect":"[On Play] If your Leader's type includes \"Whitebeard Pirates\", look at 5 cards from the top of your deck; reveal up to 1 Character with a cost of 2 and add it to your hand. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order and play up to 1 Character with a cost of 2 from your hand rested.","trigger":""},"EB02-029":{"effect":"","trigger":""},"EB02-030":{"effect":"[Counter] If any of your Characters would be K.O.'d in battle during this turn, you may trash 1 card from your hand instead.","trigger":"[Trigger] Draw 1 card."},"EB02-031":{"effect":"[Main] Look at 4 cards from the top of your deck; reveal up to 1 card with a cost of 4 or more and add it to your hand. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order.","trigger":"[Trigger] Activate this card's [Main] effect."},"EB02-032":