fect."},"EB02-041":{"effect":"[On Play] If your Leader has the {Straw Hat Crew} type, draw 1 card. [Activate: Main] You may rest this Stage: If the number of DON!! cards on your field is equal to or less than the number on your opponent's field, up to 1 of your {Straw Hat Crew} type Characters gains +2 cost until the end of your opponent's next turn.","trigger":""},"EB02-042":{"effect":"","trigger":""},"EB02-043":{"effect":"","trigger":""},"EB02-044":{"effect":"[Blocker] [On Play] Play up to 1 black {Navy} type Character with a cost of 4 or less from your trash rested.","trigger":""},"EB02-045":{"effect":"[Blocker] [On Play] You may place 2 cards from your trash at the bottom of your deck in any order: Choose one: • Draw 1 card. • If your opponent has 5 or more cards in their hand, your opponent trashes 1 card from their hand.","trigger":""},"EB02-046":{"effect":"[On Play] Trash 2 cards from the top of your deck and give up to 1 of your opponent's Characters −1 cost during this turn.","trigger":""},"EB02-047":{"effect":"[Activate: Main] You may trash 1 card from your hand and trash this Character: Play up to 1 Character with a type including \"CP\" and a cost of 5 or less other than [Blueno] from your trash.","trigger":""},"EB02-048":{"effect":"[On Play] Add up to 1 [Laboon] from your trash to your hand. [On K.O.] Play up to 1 [Laboon] with a cost of 4 or less from your hand.","trigger":""},"EB02-049":{"effect":"[On Play] Give up to 2 rested DON!! cards to your Leader. [Activate: Main] You may rest this Character: If your Leader is [Monkey.D.Garp], K.O. up to 1 of your opponent's Characters with a cost of 1 or less.","trigger":""},"EB02-050":{"effect":"[Main] Look at 4 cards from the top of your deck; reveal up to 1 card with a cost of 4 or more and add it to your hand. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order.","trigger":"[Trigger] Activate this card's [Main] effect."},"EB02-051":{"effect":"[Main] Choose one: • K.O. up to 1 of your opponent's Ch